        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 227.7,
          "end": 228.2,
          "en": "And we get this default event object here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 228.2,
          "end": 232.133,
          "en": "Automatically, we don't need to do anything to get this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 232.133,
          "end": 235.666,
          "en": "Since we passed this function to react basically,",
